COMMENT ON COLUMN rail_platform_booking.capability_version IS '登记时站台有效能力版本，历史发布记录据此保留当时能力；之后能力升级不回写';
COMMENT ON COLUMN rail_platform_booking.created_at IS '登记时刻，UTC 毫秒';
